    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308870/extras/8812c2f9e89c285b10a89c657fe2ad6e.avif?t=1754905803\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308870/extras/57ea59dfd91f5c366ba3eb81f216920f.poster.avif?t=1754905803\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308870/extras/57ea59dfd91f5c366ba3eb81f216920f.webm?t=1754905803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bold lines</strong>. Dark fantasy. Big personalities. Tired of usual shiny aesthetic? Dive into gritty, comic-book universe where every frame just hits different. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated voiced scenes? Check! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good vibes? Sure! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun stories? You betcha! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With awesome original and collab events all year, you\u2019ll never run out of reasons to stay up past midnight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308870/extras/92690bed7694ffd6a6f482a286561e69.webp?t=1754905803\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308870/extras/76a69d8e4fac26e989faec5b46e1d11e.avif?t=1754905803\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2308870/extras/a39e064cd2c9bdefffcc5ea3c0ed420c.poster.avif?t=1754905803\"